<title>USA: Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 10-3/4 in New York.</title>
<headline>Asia Pulp &amp; Paper at 10-3/4 in New York.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-03-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Asian Pulp &amp; Paper closed at 10-3/4 in New York on Wednesday. It recorded the day's low of 10-3/4 and the day's high of 11.</p>
<p>Volume was 91,400 American Depository Shares. Block volume was 77,600. Its previous close on Tuesday was 11.</p>
<p>One ADS represents four common shares.</p>
<p>-- Jakarta newsroom (Tel: 6221-3846364).</p>
</text>
